<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch 3-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch 3-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on July 17, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on July 15.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on July 10, raised 978.05 million francs and was priced at 99.677 percent to yield 1.282 percent annually. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 258 7340</p>
